{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/sdc02_0235.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/sdc02_0235.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_stopper",
      "hash64": "57E0BF973EE9C29A",
      "text": "哎呀？真是見外。\\n冠軍[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\r\\n我們再聊幾句如何呢？[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_01",
      "hash64": "2C6DB2047B65B9C8",
      "text": "好久不見，\\n冠軍[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_01",
      "hash64": "D979C6BDBDC55680",
      "text": "又見面啦！\\n辛俐姐姐我也在喲。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_02",
      "hash64": "D979C9BDBDC55B99",
      "text": "我做夢也沒想到\\n能和[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳見到面！[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_02",
      "hash64": "2C6DB5047B65BEE1",
      "text": "看來[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳即使離開了帕底亞，\\n也仍然作為帕底亞冠軍\\r\\n發揮著[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的才能。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_select_01",
      "hash64": "ABB7C9C24ACDCE91",
      "text": "我很努力！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_select_02",
      "hash64": "ABB7C6C24ACDC978",
      "text": "因為我是冠軍！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_03",
      "hash64": "2C6DB4047B65BD2E",
      "text": "呵呵……\\n真不愧是我看上的逸材。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_04",
      "hash64": "D979CBBDBDC55EFF",
      "text": "就是說啊，好人才，真人才……[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_05",
      "hash64": "D979CABDBDC55D4C",
      "text": "不對，就算是個逸材！[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_06",
      "hash64": "D979CDBDBDC56265",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳沒有得到許可\\n就跑到巨坑裡面去了吧！[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_07",
      "hash64": "D979CCBDBDC560B2",
      "text": "關於這件事，\\n我得要好好生[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳一頓氣！[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_select_03",
      "hash64": "ABB7C7C24ACDCB2B",
      "text": "對不起……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_select_04",
      "hash64": "ABB7CCC24ACDD3AA",
      "text": "但我是冠軍！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_08",
      "hash64": "D979CFBDBDC565CB",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳現在知道錯了啊！辛俐姐姐我啊，\\n聽到這件事時都從椅子上摔下來了！[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_09",
      "hash64": "D979CEBDBDC56418",
      "text": "就算是冠軍也不行！\\n不行的事，就是不～行！[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_04",
      "hash64": "2C6DB7047B65C247",
      "text": "好了好了，辛俐，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]他她平安無事就好。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_05",
      "hash64": "2C6DB6047B65C094",
      "text": "而且，要是冠軍[VAR 0x0100(0000)]\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]他她沒有去第零區的話，\\r\\n現在帕底亞恐怕已經出了大事了，不是嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_10",
      "hash64": "D97661BDBDC2750A",
      "text": "那個嘛……倒也沒錯？[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_11",
      "hash64": "D97662BDBDC276BD",
      "text": "看在大將的面子上，\\n我就睜一隻眼閉一隻眼啦。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_06",
      "hash64": "2C6DB9047B65C5AD",
      "text": "辛俐她也一直很擔心[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳喔。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_07",
      "hash64": "2C6DB8047B65C3FA",
      "text": "那麼，冠軍[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_08",
      "hash64": "2C6DAB047B65ADE3",
      "text": "這次，你們將在寶可夢聯盟的\\n官方許可之下前往第零區。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_09",
      "hash64": "2C6DAA047B65AC30",
      "text": "關於之前那據說在最深處\\n發生的時光機事件，\\r\\n只有一部分的人知道。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_10",
      "hash64": "2C6A2D047B62A1F2",
      "text": "但考量到第零區的危險性，\\n我還是告訴了白蕾雅。\\r\\n只是有稍微模糊了一些細節。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_12",
      "hash64": "D9765FBDBDC271A4",
      "text": "對了，妳不是有東西要\\n交給那個叫白蕾雅的人？[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_11",
      "hash64": "2C6A2E047B62A3A5",
      "text": "……我疏忽了。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_12",
      "hash64": "2C6A2B047B629E8C",
      "text": "冠軍[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n我能把這東西交給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_13",
      "hash64": "D97660BDBDC27357",
      "text": "那是什麼東西？\\n招式學習器？[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_13",
      "hash64": "2C6A2C047B62A03F",
      "text": "這是過去由第零區的研究者\\n寄給贊助者的光碟。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_14",
      "hash64": "2C6A29047B629B26",
      "text": "我讓調查部調查過，\\n這當然不是招式學習器。\\r\\n但似乎也不是單純的儲存媒體。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_15",
      "hash64": "2C6A2A047B629CD9",
      "text": "雖然我對它的使用方法一點頭緒都沒有，\\n但它應該是和第零區有關的東西。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_16",
      "hash64": "2C6A27047B6297C0",
      "text": "既然你們要前往第零區，\\n我想趁著機會難得，\\r\\n不如就請你們順便調查一下這個光碟。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_14",
      "hash64": "D9765DBDBDC26E3E",
      "text": "呃，妳說得好像要[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]他她順便\\n買個馬鈴薯沙拉來一樣輕鬆……[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_17",
      "hash64": "2C6A28047B629973",
      "text": "如果沒有機會用上的話，\\n請記得要將它歸還。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_18",
      "hash64": "2C6A35047B62AF8A",
      "text": "……第零區還有很多\\n尚未被解開的謎題。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_19",
      "hash64": "2C6A36047B62B13D",
      "text": "雖然[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳曾經去過一次最深處，\\n但對於那裡的地形和寶可夢，\\r\\n還是要請[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳千萬小心。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_20",
      "hash64": "2C6727047B6061E9",
      "text": "作為冠軍，\\n就請[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳好好引領大家了。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_15",
      "hash64": "D9765EBDBDC26FF1",
      "text": "……其實辛俐姐姐我也很想跟著去，\\n但我有工作，走不開啊。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_16",
      "hash64": "D9765BBDBDC26AD8",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n別勉強，差不多地加把勁啊～[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_21",
      "hash64": "2C6726047B606036",
      "text": "那麼，我們先告辭了。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_brother_01",
      "hash64": "3C46D606237D94A9",
      "text": "第零區……是嗎？\\n快走吧。我很想去。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_sister_01",
      "hash64": "E5ED13B7E0189975",
      "text": "阿栗格外地安靜。\\n……他沒事吧？\\c\\n他輸了之後，\\n明明看起來整個人都亂了方寸……[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
